WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.447
Each sample updates as you choose a font.

00:00:03.497 --> 00:00:07.906
Save a draft and preview the real pages to check readability.

00:00:07.956 --> 00:00:11.487
Font changes publish independently from Settings.

00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:14.630
For this demonstration, we save the choice,

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.431
then discard it to restore the published typography.
